{"title":"Python Selenium 实战：元素属性获取与信息交互详解","slug":"2024-07-26-selenium_信息交互","date":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","updated":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-07-26-selenium_信息交互.json","excerpt":"前言在进行 Web 自动化测试或爬虫开发时，仅仅定位到元素是不够的，我们经常需要获取元素的特定属性（如 class、href）、标签名或者元素内部的文本信息。Selenium WebDriver 提供了一系列简单易用的接口来完成这些交互操作。本文将以百度首页为例，演示如何使用 Python 的 Selenium 库获取元素的各项关键信息。","covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在进行 Web 自动化测试或爬虫开发时，仅仅定位到元素是不够的，我们经常需要获取元素的特定属性（如 <code>class</code>、<code>href</code>）、标签名或者元素内部的文本信息。Selenium WebDriver 提供了一系列简单易用的接口来完成这些交互操作。</p>\n<p>本文将以百度首页为例，演示如何使用 Python 的 Selenium 库获取元素的各项关键信息。</p>\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\n<h2 id=\"核心代码实现\"><a href=\"#核心代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心代码实现\"></a>核心代码实现</h2><p>下面的代码演示了如何初始化浏览器，定位百度首页的搜索按钮，并获取其属性与文本信息。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> webdriver</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 初始化浏览器驱动</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver = webdriver.Chrome()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 访问目标网址</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://www.baidu.com&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver.get(url)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. 定位元素：通过 ID 定位百度搜索按钮</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：变量名避免使用 input，以免覆盖 Python 内置函数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">search_btn = driver.find_element(by=<span class=\"string\">&quot;id&quot;</span>, value=<span class=\"string\">&quot;su&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. 获取元素属性值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 获取该元素的 class 属性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;Class 属性: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;search_btn.get_attribute(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;class&#x27;</span>)&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 5. 获取标签名</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;标签名: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;search_btn.tag_name&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 6. 获取元素文本内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：&lt;input&gt; 标签通常为自闭合标签，通过 .text 获取不到 value 属性中的文字</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># .text 获取的是元素标签对中间的文本内容，例如 &lt;a&gt;文本&lt;/a&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># print(search_btn.text)  # 此处输出通常为空</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 实例：获取“新闻”链接的文本</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">news_link = driver.find_element(by=<span class=\"string\">&quot;link text&quot;</span>, value=<span class=\"string\">&quot;新闻&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;链接文本: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;news_link.text&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 7. 关闭浏览器</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver.quit()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 关键方法解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 1. 获取属性值：`get_attribute()`</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">`get_attribute(name)` 方法用于获取元素指定的属性值。这是最常用的方法之一，可以获取 `<span class=\"built_in\">id</span>`、`<span class=\"keyword\">class</span>`、`name`、`href` 等标准属性，也可以获取自定义属性。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 示例：获取 class 属性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">class_name = element.get_attribute(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;class&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 2. 获取标签名：`tag_name`</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">`tag_name` 属性可以直接返回元素的 HTML 标签名称（如 `<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>`、`div`、`a`），返回值为字符串类型，且为小写形式。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">tag = element.tag_name</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出示例: &#x27;input&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 3. 获取文本内容：`.text`</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">`.text` 属性用于获取元素标签**内部**的可见文本内容。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **适用场景**：获取 `&lt;a&gt;`、`&lt;span&gt;`、`&lt;div&gt;` 等容器标签内的文字。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **不适用场景**：对于 `&lt;<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>&gt;` 或 `&lt;img&gt;` 等自闭合标签，`.text` 通常返回空字符串。如果要获取输入框内的文字，应使用 `get_attribute(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;value&#x27;</span>)`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 获取链接文本</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">text_content = news_link.text</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出: 新闻</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">通过 Selenium 进行信息交互是自动化脚本与页面“对话”的关键环节。区分 `.text`（获取显式文本）与 `get_attribute()`（获取标签属性）的使用场景，能够帮助我们更准确地提取所需数据。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">| 方法/属性 | 用途 | 返回示例 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| :--- | :--- | :--- |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `get_attribute(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;attr&#x27;</span>)` | 获取指定属性的值 | `<span class=\"string\">&quot;bg s_btn&quot;</span>` |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `tag_name` | 获取标签名称 | `<span class=\"string\">&quot;input&quot;</span>` |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `.text` | 获取标签内文本 | `<span class=\"string\">&quot;新闻&quot;</span>` |</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">希望这篇教程对你有所帮助！</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"核心代码实现\"><a href=\"#核心代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心代码实现\"></a>核心代码实现</h2><p>下面的代码演示了如何初始化浏览器，定位百度首页的搜索按钮，并获取其属性与文本信息。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> webdriver</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 初始化浏览器驱动</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver = webdriver.Chrome()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 访问目标网址</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://www.baidu.com&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver.get(url)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. 定位元素：通过 ID 定位百度搜索按钮</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：变量名避免使用 input，以免覆盖 Python 内置函数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">search_btn = driver.find_element(by=<span class=\"string\">&quot;id&quot;</span>, value=<span class=\"string\">&quot;su&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. 获取元素属性值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 获取该元素的 class 属性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;Class 属性: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;search_btn.get_attribute(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;class&#x27;</span>)&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 5. 获取标签名</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;标签名: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;search_btn.tag_name&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 6. 获取元素文本内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：&lt;input&gt; 标签通常为自闭合标签，通过 .text 获取不到 value 属性中的文字</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># .text 获取的是元素标签对中间的文本内容，例如 &lt;a&gt;文本&lt;/a&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># print(search_btn.text)  # 此处输出通常为空</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 实例：获取“新闻”链接的文本</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">news_link = driver.find_element(by=<span class=\"string\">&quot;link text&quot;</span>, value=<span class=\"string\">&quot;新闻&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;链接文本: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;news_link.text&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 7. 关闭浏览器</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver.quit()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 关键方法解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 1. 获取属性值：`get_attribute()`</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">`get_attribute(name)` 方法用于获取元素指定的属性值。这是最常用的方法之一，可以获取 `<span class=\"built_in\">id</span>`、`<span class=\"keyword\">class</span>`、`name`、`href` 等标准属性，也可以获取自定义属性。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 示例：获取 class 属性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">class_name = element.get_attribute(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;class&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 2. 获取标签名：`tag_name`</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">`tag_name` 属性可以直接返回元素的 HTML 标签名称（如 `<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>`、`div`、`a`），返回值为字符串类型，且为小写形式。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">tag = element.tag_name</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出示例: &#x27;input&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 3. 获取文本内容：`.text`</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">`.text` 属性用于获取元素标签**内部**的可见文本内容。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **适用场景**：获取 `&lt;a&gt;`、`&lt;span&gt;`、`&lt;div&gt;` 等容器标签内的文字。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **不适用场景**：对于 `&lt;<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>&gt;` 或 `&lt;img&gt;` 等自闭合标签，`.text` 通常返回空字符串。如果要获取输入框内的文字，应使用 `get_attribute(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;value&#x27;</span>)`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 获取链接文本</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">text_content = news_link.text</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出: 新闻</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">通过 Selenium 进行信息交互是自动化脚本与页面“对话”的关键环节。区分 `.text`（获取显式文本）与 `get_attribute()`（获取标签属性）的使用场景，能够帮助我们更准确地提取所需数据。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">| 方法/属性 | 用途 | 返回示例 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| :--- | :--- | :--- |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `get_attribute(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;attr&#x27;</span>)` | 获取指定属性的值 | `<span class=\"string\">&quot;bg s_btn&quot;</span>` |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `tag_name` | 获取标签名称 | `<span class=\"string\">&quot;input&quot;</span>` |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| `.text` | 获取标签内文本 | `<span class=\"string\">&quot;新闻&quot;</span>` |</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">希望这篇教程对你有所帮助！</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"技术开发","path":"api/categories/技术开发.json"},{"name":"爬虫","path":"api/categories/爬虫.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Spider","path":"api/tags/Spider.json"},{"name":"Selenium","path":"api/tags/Selenium.json"},{"name":"Web自动化","path":"api/tags/Web自动化.json"}]}